		(uuid "3d2a1b8d-9a57-55d4-aeb2-a4bf709265db")
	)
	(text "Pin plan (STM32G0B1RBT6, LQFP64; the CBT6 of Rev D is not stocked at JLC, same die, same pin names)\nSPI1   PA5 SCK, PA6 MISO, PA7 MOSI, PA4 /CS DAC, PB0 /CS ADC, PB1 LOAD_OFF (isolator)\nI2C1   PB6 SCL, PB7 SDA: the OLED module (page 4). No display driver, no level shifter.\nTIM3   PB4 / PB5 encoder, PB3 push.  TIM17 PB9 fan PWM, TIM16 PB8 tach, PD3 FAN_EN\nADC    PA0 / PA1 = CC1 / CC2.  USB PA11 DM, PA12 DP, crystal-less (CRS)\nUSART1 PA9 / PA10 debug.  PD0 ON/OFF, PD1 MODE, PD2 MENU.  PC6 heartbeat LED, PA8 ON LED, PC7 FAULT LED\nWhy not the STM32F103C8T6 ($1.50 at JLC): no USB DFU in its ROM (USART only), needs a crystal, no\nCRS; the G0B1 ROM DFU is what removes the second USB port. Swap it in if you have an ST-Link and F103s.\nSpare: PA2, PA3, PA15, PB2, PB10-PB15, PC0-PC5, PC8-PC15, PD4-PD9, PF0, PF1 (NC)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 31.49 237.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2c76898e-c218-5740-894f-5c39151a6c5f")
	)
	(text "A   Microcontroller"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.4 55.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a1069d5e-74bf-562c-976e-29d3b7123571")
	)
	(text "All X7R. One 100 nF per VDD pin, 1 uF + 100 nF at VREF+ (C17, C18).\nPlace within 2 mm of the pins."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 251.49 81.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3d3cf995-3503-536e-994f-963246f1fcc0")
	)
	(text "B   Decoupling"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 247.11 44.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.5 2.5)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 50 120 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ae44e8d1-be45-5bc0-8068-c515bd8af114")
	)
	(text "BOOT0 shares PA14 (SWCLK) on the STM32G0. Hold BOOT, tap RESET: the ROM bootloader\nenumerates as USB DFU. Once, with STM32CubeProgrammer, clear option bit nBOOT_SEL so\nthe pin is honoured (the factory default ignores it)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 251.49 155.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(face "JetBrains Mono")
				(size 2.0 2.0)
				(color 40 40 40 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c38375a9-5415-525e-91f9-3e3c91228ea0")
	)
